what is Arrays?
   Arrays are group of similar data types.
   there is two types of arrays,
                  1.fixed array ---->  size can be fixed at start.
                  2.Dynamic array--->  size can be grow or shrink anytime

Syntax :
     //fixed array
      string[6] names;
    //Dynamic array
      string[] names;
  [the values are stored and retrive by index values]
  eg :
      storeing:
            names[0]="bob";
            names[1]="riya";
            name[2]="sam";
      retriving :
            names[index];

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Array functions :
              push--->add element at end
              pop---->remove last
              length-->length of the array (array size)

      fixed                        dynamic
 string[4] arr                   string[] arr
 fixed size                      unlimited size
 use by index                    use push 
 size never changes              size changes
